# Earthrumbler, {4}{G} Vehicle 7/6, vigilance and trample: "Exile an artifact or creature card from your graveyard: This Vehicle becomes
# an artifact creature until end of turn." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with Black Lotus (sacrificed, so an artifact card in its graveyard), a
# green Mox Emerald and a Mox Jet, and Lightning Bolts its own Memnite (a creature card in the graveyard). Earthrumbler is no creature
# (no power) until it is animated. Bot1 may not exile the Lightning Bolt (neither an artifact nor a creature card), exiles the Memnite,
# and Earthrumbler is a 7/6 creature with vigilance and trample for the turn. On turn 2 it is no creature again (CR 611.2a, until end of
# turn). On turn 3 Bot1 kills Bot2's Memnite with a second Bolt (a creature card in Bot2's graveyard, which Earthrumbler cannot exile),
# exiles its own Black Lotus (the only card it may), attacks, and being a 7/6 vigilance creature it deals 7 and does not tap.

